- question-state: OPEN
- question: what is the sha256 of the TM1637 V2.4 PDF that every page citation in this document resolves against?
- why-it-matters: every factual claim here is anchored to a page number in a document identified only by a version string. Titan Micro datasheets circulate in several scans and translations; a page-3 quote is only checkable if the reader has THE SAME FILE.
- current-state: the descriptor records `datasheet_sha256` as "NOT YET RECORDED". That is an honest placeholder and an open integrity gap, not a formality.
