### [CXC-TM1637-EV-07] EV-07 — display off while the host keeps writing

- evidence-state: EMPTY
- question: send the display-OFF command while the host CONTINUES writing values. Do all tubes blank?
- expected: ALL tubes blank, and stay blank, while writes continue
- discriminates: this is what separates "display off" from "wrote zeros". A test that stops writing cannot tell them apart, and the two have different failure consequences on a live panel.
- grounds-claim: [CXC-TM1637-PART]
- observed: ⛔ EMPTY
- observed-on-date: ⛔ EMPTY
- observed-by: ⛔ EMPTY
- part-of: [CXC-TM1637-EV-INDEX]

